# Sylli Security Allowlist
#
# Add one exception per line to bypass specific security restrictions.
# Every bypass is logged to .opencode/security_audit.log with a [BYPASS] entry.
#
# Supported directives:
#   path:<absolute path>     Allow this exact path (and anything below it).
#   path-re:<regex>          Allow any path matching the regex.
#   cmd-re:<regex>           Allow any shell command matching the regex.
#   til:<ISO timestamp>      The whole allowlist auto-expires at this time
#                            (e.g. til:2026-11-12T18:00 — restrictions
#                            come back into force automatically).
#
# Lines starting with # are comments. Invalid regexes are ignored.
#
# Examples:
#   path:/etc/hosts
#   path-re:/etc/nginx/.*
#   cmd-re:^sudo systemctl restart nginx
#   til:2026-11-12T18:00
